+/*
+ * 0141 d2sfb_log. Bit 0: every 10 s of presents one line with swaps, presents (and how many
+ * changed no row), rows copied per present, copy and DECON-wait time (avg/max), DECON polls,
+ * wait timeouts, races (d2sfb_mask=1: DECON busy right after the masked copy) and misses
+ * (d2sfb_dirty=2). Bit 1: for a finger-down (SweetHIDTouch::touch), the time to the end of
+ * the first present that started after it and to the first one that changed panel rows
+ * (with d2sfb_dirty=0 every present changes all rows), printed once per touch. A down that
+ * came while another was followed is dropped.
